}\\theta }(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta )={sech}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,⇒\\,\\int {sech}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =\\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta +C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (4-3{sech}^{2}⁡\\theta )\\,\\text{d}\\theta  & =\\int 4\\,\\text{d}\\theta +\\int (-3{sech}^{2}⁡\\theta )\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =4\\int \\,\\text{d}\\theta -3\\int {sech}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =4\\theta -3\\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta +C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540120 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186540173 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540120 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "0e7302eb-f9b0-5746-9b38-56ab44f97bec" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540120 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186360657 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540138 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186540120 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540138 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "521b2668-06f0-5a0c-b6fd-78857ff1ecd8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540138 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186360654 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540163 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186540180 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540163 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b3337935-86ec-55dd-bf71-539e84f21a0e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540163 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186540078 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540173 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186540163 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540173 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "df6d28aa-40d2-5b95-a711-dba37989fc3f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540173 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186360660 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540180 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "fd35000b-7e0c-574d-a60e-f261c0e0cc6c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540180 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186360670 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
